cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
value.1	1	converter	convert					the input values are read in the order the module supplies them, never sorted
value.2	1	converter	convert					each value is given its position in the whole input, a part keeping its positions
value.3	1	converter	convert					every input value is accepted, of any depth of nesting
value.4	1	converter	convert	non-conforming	0 #			an input value JSON text rejects, as names not unique, is rejected
value.5	1	converter	convert					what JSON text leaves out is left out of the file, each place reported as not carried by its JSON Pointer within the input, led by its input value's position
